# A session of test/lib/lsp, which check_install replays (not a
# `.session`, which every run replays with `zig` on PATH): the server
# editor/install builds, with no zig-env.zon beside it and no `zig` on
# its PATH, as VS Code started from the Dock runs it. `@import("std")`
# then names no file, and the server logs it once, with the setting to
# set and hooks.zig's `unresolvedImport`; `util.zig` is beside the file.
initialize folder quiet
open main.zig
save main.zig
